    "detailed_description": "A Platforming Dungeon Crawler with a strong focus on cooperative play. Explore the world of Nona with your friends or adventure solo.<br><br>Project Amaranth is an ambitious game a group of friends started back in High School. Now it is a lifelong passion project.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/41fadfd0053ad31756a45541215c8bb6.poster.avif?t=1732679958\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/41fadfd0053ad31756a45541215c8bb6.apng?t=1732679958\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A movement system with a high skill ceiling.<br></li><li>A versatile map editor. The player can create their own worlds!<br></li><li>10 playable classes<br></li><li>Challenging Dungeons to explore.<br></li><li>Cooperative gameplay.<br></li><li>A variety of game modes.</li></ul><br>Neutral <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/86a09d39bf44a9ce6bb9661f75598d59.webp?t=1732679958\" /></div> is the default element everyone spawns as. Find an elemental shrine to transform into one of the 9 elemental forms. Each element has its own unique move set, animations, and abilities. The player can choose between them to suit their play style and the challenges of each dungeon.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/a60265f22ee850925b9a549519683d47.webp?t=1732679958\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/21566d07a24c271f71803ff50557a50e.webp?t=1732679958\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/ca5ee970bc9ac779d122c36537922737.webp?t=1732679958\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/3aa9c692028f7e267227edb465a94e28.webp?t=1732679958\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/70c5065013fc14234283b044ba8f9dc6.webp?t=1732679958\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/012d55723d58494cb9e1a561a55e320f.webp?t=1732679958\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/39e7972a3a9ae7c4734803dd477fce6b.webp?t=1732679958\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/48ee7e925cd08f83b5443928cecb7e60.webp?t=1732679958\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/544360/extras/7b83b5d87f618afb0340457d7a929ac4.webp?t=1732679958\" /></div><br><br>The movement system is challenging, but will reward players with a variety of engaging agility options.<br>Single-player and multiplayer is supported, as well as syncing custom maps and dungeons. A separate server client is needed to host a multiplayer world<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Developers Wanted</h2>We are a small, passionate team that is looking for additional developers. Whether you are still learning or experienced, we would love to get you on board. <br>Please see the Discord for additional information. This is a passion project, not a job offer.",
